            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.31</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Mailbox: Mail no longer shows "No access" or "No accounts" when Apple Mail
      is just busy. Sync keeps working, and Jarvis now explains what to do.</li>
  <li>If Mail hasn't been set up yet, an Open Mail button takes you there, and
      Jarvis syncs again when you come back.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
